00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:26.830
If words won't work, I'll let my fists do the talking!

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:30.630
That was my Kamogawa Dynamite Bomber, taught to me by my Sis!

00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:35.260
You've trampled on Yurikano's feelings enough!

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:37.260
Don't you two get it by now?

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:40.180
You both mean a lot to Yurikano!

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:45.190
She hated seeing the two of you fight.

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:48.480
But you both did it again.

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:49.650
You let her down!

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:52.740
That's why Yurikano had to leave again.

00:00:54.110 --> 00:00:55.030
Madoka...

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:56.360
Not just Yurikano!

00:00:56.860 --> 00:00:59.490
You hurt Lan and Muginami too!

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:02.500
Don't you see that?!

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:07.960
