00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:43.050
A Vow Made in Kamogawa

00:02:45.780 --> 00:02:49.780
So, what became of the Vox Core possessed by Le Garite?

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:54.940
We're told it was destroyed during the subspace distortion that took place in the fleet ship.

00:02:54.940 --> 00:03:00.570
So now, everyone knows that Dizelmine was plotting to attack De Metrio

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:02.110
using the Vox and Yurikano.

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:04.370
It certainly looks that way.

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:08.580
Will you still proceed with the Intergalactic Conference as scheduled?

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:09.330
Yes.

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:13.540
But it appears Dizelmine will not be joining the conference.

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:15.340
After coming all this way...

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:20.090
Let's just hope this doesn't turn into a trial <i>in absentia</i>.

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:33.690
Did you come here to mock me?

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:40.690
I resorted to using my enemy's sister as part of my plan.

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:44.410
But instead, I was thrown off by her confession.

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:46.910
And now, I have lost everything.

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:51.460
Are you done moping yet?

00:03:57.840 --> 00:03:59.510
Don't you get it?

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:02.840
<i>Don't you two get it?</i>

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:08.390
<i>I don't know all the complicated details</i> <i>of the Polyhedron problem,</i>

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:10.140
<i>but there's still time, right?</i>

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:13.230
<i>In that case, why not work together</i> <i>to find a solution?</i>

00:04:13.890 --> 00:04:14.650
<i>I think you're despicable!</i>

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:18.070
Isn't that what she said?

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:23.240
Not only did that girl punch two kings,

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:25.160
she even lectured both of us.

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.700
How's that for completely losing face?

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:30.120
And it was a pretty good punch too.

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:34.250
Unfortunately, she's right.

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:35.500
It's not just you.

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:38.670
What the hell have we been doing this whole time?

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:42.800
I don't care about what you think of me.

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:46.550
But is what happened between us

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:50.180
really worth shedding so much blood and so many tears?

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:59.150
I became king because this time...

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:07.070
I wanted to move forward together with you for the sake of the Polyhedron.

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:12.160
Can you find it in yourself to forgive me?

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:18.380
Unless we resolve our differences, my sister won't find peace.

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:26.050
I see...

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:29.350
Here at the Kamogawa Municipal Auditorium,

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:34.220
the Polyhedron Intergalactic Conference is about to begin.

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:37.850
As each of the various Polyhedron representatives arrived,

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:40.560
Kamogawa was in a festive mood,

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:43.690
but yesterday's accident aboard the Le Garite flagship,

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:46.570
in satellite orbit above Earth, has caused an uproar.

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:49.660
Sorry we're late.

00:05:58.120 --> 00:06:01.250
First, regarding to the Polyhedron problem,

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:03.800
the fact that the incident will not take place for another millennium

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:07.050
has led our thinking astray.

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:11.850
Or rather, I alone went astray.

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:14.720
As all of you gathered here are aware,

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:21.400
it was my decision alone to use the power of the Vox and to resort to force.

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:23.190
I'd like to use this opportunity to apologize.

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:29.950
Without a concrete plan to deal with the Polyhedron problem,

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:34.660
I believe that right now, the best we can do is put our heads together

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:36.700
to come up with a solution.

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:42.670
Therefore, as a first step, King Dizelmine and I will join forces

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:47.550
to bring our two nations, Le Garite and De Metrio, together

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:49.090
to reaffirm and renew friendly relations.

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:51.970
Come on.

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:53.930
Right...

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:11.320
Does this mean the relationship between the two kings has been resolved?

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:14.160
So they've declared a ceasefire?

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:18.370
A perfect example of friendship cemented by quarrels,

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:20.160
don't you think?

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:25.290
Looks like the girls won't have to go out on missions anymore.

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:27.590
It does seem that way.

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:30.470
<i>As a start, King Dizelmine</i> <i>stated that henceforth,</i>

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:36.930
<i>Le Garite would not use the Vox to solve</i> <i>the Polyhedron 1000-year Problem.</i>

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:39.220
Isn't it awesome?

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:41.730
Who could've predicted that the Intergalactic Conference

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:43.770
would take such an exciting turn!

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:46.900
I agree. This calls for a toast.

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:48.530
Right, Tadokoro?

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:49.860
Yes.

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:54.410
<i>20,000 years ago,</i> <i>the people who fled Earth</i> <i>were scattered throughout</i> <i>the Universe.</i>

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:56.280
<i>Today, through a strange twist of fate,</i>

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:59.330
<i>their descendants have returned</i> <i>to this planet and become one again.</i>

00:07:57.370 --> 00:08:00.870
So, what became of the Vox Core possessed by Le Garite?

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:03.870
<i>To be able to stand here at</i> <i>that historical moment</i> <i>is a truly joyous event</i> <i>for humankind!</i>

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:08.670
Does this mean it's finally over?

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:10.710
Yeah, I guess it is...

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:14.510
No, let's hope it is.

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:30.230
We still have a mountain of problems ahead.

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:32.900
I don't know how much we'll be able to do,

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:34.400
but all we can do is try.

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:36.410
Yeah...

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:38.870
Hey!

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:40.740
Hey!

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:42.750
Hey!

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:46.170
I saw it on TV!

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:48.040
You guys buried the hatchet!

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:50.590
Did you come all this way just to tell us that?

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:51.380
Yup.

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:52.840
Absolutely!

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:57.590
We don't want to get punched like that again.

00:08:57.590 --> 00:08:58.550
Right?

00:08:58.890 --> 00:08:59.760
Yeah.

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:01.390
Thank you.

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:03.730
Per...?

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:10.820
Success!

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:21.330
Miss Madoka.

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:21.990
Huh?

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:23.580
What is it?

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:26.120
I have a favor to ask.

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:46.640
Just a minute!

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:53.190
Here!

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:56.700
Instead of asking me, you should just tell her yourself!

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:57.450
Huh?

00:09:57.450 --> 00:09:58.450
Do it!

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:04.450
Lan,

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:06.120
I'm sorry.

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:08.250
Huh?

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:14.210
I've done a lot of things to you, without thinking about your feelings.

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:15.670
Don't...

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:19.760
You have a great opportunity to learn from this planet.

00:10:19.760 --> 00:10:22.930
Make the best of it by enjoying it as much as you can.

00:10:24.510 --> 00:10:25.430
Big Brother...

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:30.350
All I ask is that you earn outstanding grades befitting a royal family member.

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:31.190
I will!

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:36.110
You've made fine friends.

00:10:36.690 --> 00:10:38.780
Yes, you're right...

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:40.950
Brother.

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:41.620
Oh?

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:44.240
You're back to calling me that again?

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:49.040
I've been meaning to ask...

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:50.040
Are you all right with this?

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:51.000
Huh?

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:52.130
What're you talking about?

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:56.380
I mean, Miss Yurikano is your real sister, and I'm...

00:10:57.710 --> 00:10:58.720
I'm...

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:02.890
just a...

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:03.890
You idiot!

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:09.390
Stop thinking about silly things and just do your best!

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:14.730
I'll be your big brother until the day I die.

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:19.360
Right!

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:26.370
These are images of the Vox deployment that took place the other day.

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:31.160
Have you determined why the Vox launched without their pilots?

00:11:31.160 --> 00:11:33.130
I don't know anything for sure yet.

00:11:33.630 --> 00:11:34.920
What's your opinion?

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:41.590
It's conceivable that they launched in response to Miss Kyono, thinking she was in danger...

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:43.550
I see...

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:45.800
Wait! Why are you here?!

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:47.890
Didn't you go back?

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:50.100
That's cold.

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:53.060
I have the Chairman's permission to stay.

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:53.770
Oh?

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:57.980
I hear you have a number of questions.

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:00.570
Especially in regards to Princess Yurikano...

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:05.780
All right, let's start with what just happened to the Vox?

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:08.120
As I said, they responded to her thoughts.

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:12.160
I think it was more a result of their training.

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:17.000
The sympathetic resonance between Aura, Lympha and Ignis has increased.

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:20.260
I'll bring up the actual numbers.

00:12:22.550 --> 00:12:25.640
Oh, this is...

00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:30.970
To me, it appears as though they are reflecting the girls' relationship with one another.

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:34.770
There's something I'd like you all to see.

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:37.190
Huh? Where's the Chairman?

