I don't understand math at all.

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:15.230
It doesn't really get any more basic than this.

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:21.980
I was behind in my studies, so I expected you to help me...

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:24.360
I suck!

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:25.650
My, my...

00:13:25.650 --> 00:13:29.740
All this brainwork makes my brain feel like it's going to explode.

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:31.280
Let's take a break!

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:32.370
Huh?

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:33.830
But we just took one.

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:35.000
Here. Snacks.

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:36.500
Wow! Baked sweet potatoes?

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:38.080
Good call, Madoka!

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:40.880
That aside...

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:52.970
What's with them?

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:55.890
Those three reek of depression.

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:59.060
I hope it's not contagious.

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:02.320
I think it's because of how Lady Yurikano disappeared.

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:05.400
It must have hit them pretty hard.

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:10.620
Why are those three so committed to Yurikano?

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:12.950
The four of them were together

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:16.370
during their time at the Academy, so...

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:19.750
You think they were in love with Yurikano?

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:26.720
Hey...

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:29.590
Have either of you ever been in love before?

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:30.390
Huh?

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:32.010
W-What? Why do you ask?!

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:34.720
Muginami, why're you so flustered?

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:37.270
I-I'm not flustered....

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:42.860
See, back there, I was able to feel Yurikano's emotions very clearly.

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:45.570
About how much she cared about Lan's brother.

00:14:46.230 --> 00:14:49.070
That must be love, right?

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:50.490
Wow...

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:54.080
Does that mean you know what love feels like, Madoka?

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:55.330
You're growing up, Madoka.

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:56.870
W-What?!

00:14:56.870 --> 00:14:59.410
Even I know that much!

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:03.960
I think it's a bit different than loving baked sweet potatoes!

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:05.250
What?!

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:11.680
But why did Yurikano tell Lan's brother that

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:15.810
she thought he was despicable at the very end?

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:20.100
I wonder how your brother felt when she told him that?

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:22.190
I don't know.

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:27.690
My brother isn't one to show his feelings.

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:30.780
I sort of feel...

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:36.370
The moment you put feelings that you've kept inside you into words,

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:38.080
those feelings disappear.

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:41.790
That's why I can understand why he doesn't want to put his feelings into words.

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:42.750
What?!

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:45.750
Isn't it better to come right out and say that you love a person?

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:48.510
I'm sure they know.

00:15:48.510 --> 00:15:51.340
If they share those feelings for each other,

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:52.970
they don't have to say it.

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:56.970
That's what I think, too.

00:15:57.390 --> 00:16:00.020
All this is pretty grown-up stuff...

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:02.350
It's going over my head.

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:04.400
I've fallen behind in this too.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:06.110
You'll be fine!

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:06.900
Here!

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:10.530
You have this, Madoka.

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:13.110
Hey! Stop making fun of me!

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:16.200
I've experienced one or two loves.

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:18.080
And another something else...

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:18.580
Huh?

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:19.410
What is it?

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:21.200
That makes three total.

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:22.540
That's not what I meant.

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:26.790
I realized one more thing that day, as well.

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:31.970
In her heart, Yurikano cares deeply not just for Lan's brother,

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:35.430
but for Big Brother Giuvi, Izo, Kirius, Array,

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:40.430
and for all of us, as well.

00:16:41.220 --> 00:16:45.350
That's why it's our turn to answer Yurikano's feelings.

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:49.150
Can you two come with me for a second?

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:55.280
It's so beautiful!

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:57.870
It always feels great up here.

00:16:57.870 --> 00:16:58.870
Lan,

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:01.540
what're you looking for?

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:04.290
Until

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:04.290
we meet

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:04.290
again

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:04.290
in Kamogawa

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:04.290
in Kamogawa

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:04.290
Madoka

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:06.790
Is that the one you two...?

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:10.710
<i>We vow...</i>

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:14.840
<i>that we will meet again in</i> <i>Kamogawa some day.</i>

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:16.260
<i>You too, Lan!</i>

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:16.720
<i>Huh?</i>

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:18.180
<i>All right. I vow too.</i>

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:19.760
<i>Good.</i>

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:24.390
<i>As long as this lock remains here,</i>

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:28.100
<i>we must honor our vow,</i> <i>no matter what.</i>

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:34.860
Looks like we made good on our vow, huh?

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:35.860
Yes.

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:39.070
And so!

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:40.280
Madoka?

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:46.040
I brought the three of us here again because I thought we could make a new vow.

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:48.210
A new vow?

00:17:48.210 --> 00:17:50.000
What will we vow?

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:54.630
I'm thinking we should vow never to go to battle using the Vox again.

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:59.180
Those two made up, right?

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:02.140
There shouldn't be any more reasons to fight.

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:23.200
I, Madoka Kyono, vow on this lock:

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:26.500
that I will never use Midori as a weapon, ever again.

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:31.210
And I vow that neither Hupo nor I will ever fight again!

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:35.670
I vow here to use Orca for peace!

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:36.970
And!

00:18:36.970 --> 00:18:39.470
Until we make good on our vow,

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:43.260
I will not graduate from the Jersey Club!

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:48.770
You sound so gung-ho, Madoka, but with your low grades,

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:51.270
isn't there a chance you might not graduate at all?

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:54.400
