00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:38.710
You know what's written on that stone tablet, don't you?

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:43.300
It's a... record of my sins.

00:20:44.930 --> 00:20:50.060
As you know, the Rin-ne has caused two tragedies in the past.

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:54.350
One is the Tragedy of Militia Zodia, brought about by Yurikano,

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:57.560
when she attempted to seal away her powers.

00:20:58.150 --> 00:21:01.070
The other happened 20,000 years ago...

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:04.820
when the Earth was nearly destroyed when the Rinne blossomed.

00:21:05.660 --> 00:21:08.120
The one who caused that tragedy...

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:10.700
was Queen Maycun.

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:12.620
And that would be you.

